title: The Cyprus settlement
view-if: cyprus_campaign_resolved == 1
new-page: true

= Cyprus — [+ cyprus_final_result +]

[? if cyprus_final_result == "Non-Intervention" : CHP was not in power when the crisis began. Turkey did not undertake this intervention, and the opportunity to secure the Turkish Cypriot position was lost. ?]
[? if cyprus_final_result == "Military Defeat" : The operation failed to establish a viable connected position, or suffered a decisive military breakdown. Turkey cannot turn its intervention into the intended settlement. ?]
[? if cyprus_final_result == "Return to the 1960 Constitutional Order" : The parties accept restoration of the constitutional framework. The crisis ends through an agreement that falls short of Turkey's federal objectives. ?]
[? if cyprus_final_result == "Denktaş Plan" : The parties agree to a federal Cyprus with a clearly defined Turkish region in the north and a Greek region in the south. ?]
[? if cyprus_final_result == "Güneş Plan" : The parties agree to a federal Cyprus containing six geographically separate autonomous Turkish cantons. ?]
[? if cyprus_final_result == "Historical Division" : The second operation is followed by the historical territorial division. A comprehensive federal agreement remains unresolved. ?]

[? if cyprus_best_ending == 1 : The Güneş settlement has been achieved without Atilla II, with strong UN cooperation: the campaign's best diplomatic outcome. ?]

Atilla I score: [+ cyprus_atilla1_score +] / 720.

[? if cyprus_atilla2_complete == 1 : Atilla II score: [+ cyprus_atilla2_score +] / 240. ?]

- @root: Return to normal play.

@root
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.exit(Q); !}
go-to: post_event
